 },
 "description": "Resolve a token ticker symbol (e.g. PEPE, WIF, USDC) to contract addresses on a chain, free. Curated majors return one verified match; others return live DEX matches ranked by liquidity so you can pick the real token over imitations. Use before get_quote when you only know the symbol.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
